cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Code and data for: Finite-Shot Operating Windows for Virtual Distillation and Symmetry Verification"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for the paper. Level 1: exact density-matrix simulation of QAOA instances
  that tests the finite-shot laws for virtual distillation (VD) and symmetry verification
  (SV). Level 2: gate-level Qiskit/Aer simulation of the same instances. Level 3: archived
  IBM hardware counts and their analysis.
